1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,116
Comment tu restes en forme ?
How do you stay fit?

2
00:00:15,216 --> 00:00:19,700
Je marche trente minutes en écoutant de la musique.
I walk for thirty minutes while listening to music.

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,628
Et pour bien dormir ?
And to sleep well?

4
00:00:22,728 --> 00:00:29,348
Je me couche tôt en lisant un livre. En faisant ça, je dors mieux.
I go to bed early while reading a book. By doing that, I sleep better.

5
00:00:29,448 --> 00:00:33,884
Moi, je mange sainement en cuisinant à la maison.
I eat healthily by cooking at home.

6
00:00:33,984 --> 00:00:39,572
C'est bien. On se sent mieux en bougeant un peu chaque jour.
That's good. You feel better by moving a bit every day.
